    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Each phase ends with a formal review and a go/no-go decision, guaranteeing that our company's meet the project's requirements while maintaining controlled annual operating costs compatible with the authority's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By adapting our flagship product, Atelier, which is a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organization's own documents to the hospital's specific needs and integrating our flagship product, Atelier, which is a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organization's own documents with existing systems, such as the hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), our company's can ensure a seamless and efficient solution that meets the project's requirements and stays within the allocated budget of €900,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution requires a response time below 2 seconds for common queries, an availability target of 99.9%, and integration with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also support health interoperability standards (HL7/FHIR) and provide API-type interfaces." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current technology stack meet these requirements, and what architecture do you propose to ensure The solution performance, availability, and interoperability? our platform, Atelier, is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can be used to meet the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The median latency of Our platform, Atelier is 1.3 seconds, and common queries have a p95 latency below 2 seconds, which satisfies the response time requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For availability, our hosting options include the Sovereign HDS tier on OuraneCloud, which provides 99.9% availability, meeting the client's requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our use Kubernetes for containerisation, which allows for active-active deployment across two availability zones and supports high availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding integration with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), our architecture and integration capabilities include standard connectors and custom adapters for SIH/DPI integration, which can be used to meet this requirement.  our also support health interoperability standards, including HL7/FHIR, through our partner Ligeo Santé, as mentioned in the health interoperability section of our architecture and integration capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For API-type interfaces, our follow an API-first approach with REST and webhook APIs that are documented and can be embedded in existing work environments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure The solution performance, availability, and interoperability, I propose a deployment on the Sovereign HDS tier on OuraneCloud, which provides the required availability and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our platform, Atelier will be configured to integrate with the client's SIH and DPI systems using standard connectors and custom adapters as needed.  our API-first approach will provide the necessary interfaces for integration with other systems, and our will work with our partner Ligeo Santé to ensure compliance with health interoperability standards. our will also monitor Our platform, Atelier performance and availability closely to ensure that Our platform, Atelier continues to meet the client's requirements over time." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The titleholder must guarantee strict compliance with GDPR, preserve medical confidentiality, and protect sensitive data through encryption or pseudonymisation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting must be performed on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent within the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are our company's certifications, GDPR instruments, AI security controls, and experience with the European Union regulatory frameworks to ensure compliance with these requirements? our company's holds ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of our company's services, including data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's are certified with ISO 27701, an extension for privacy information management, demonstrating our company's commitment to handling personal data securely." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR compliance, our company's have experience delivering solutions to public-sector and health clients, including those involving special-category (Article 9) health data. our company's Data Protection Officer is appointed, and our company's maintain a data processing register. our company's also have a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) available, aligned with GDPR Article 28." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For security controls related to AI, our company's Secure Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC) includes code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing performed by an external CREST-equivalent provider. our company's also have defined remediation SLAs for vulnerabilities and a structured incident response plan in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To protect sensitive data, our company's use encryption in transit with TLS 1.3 and at rest with AES-256, managed through our company's the European Union infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Pseudonymisation is also implemented where relevant. our company's hosting partner, OuraneCloud, is SecNumCloud-qualified, ensuring that the infrastructure meets stringent security standards. our company's experience with the European Union regulatory frameworks includes familiarity with CNIL guidance, the HDS reference framework, and HAS guidance on AI in healthcare. our company's map our company's platform features to applicable obligations, providing audit evidence when needed. map allows our company's to support clients in navigating complex compliance requirements while leveraging AI solutions securely." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must comply with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, and medical responsibility constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No clinical or medico-administrative decision may be automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the legal risks associated with this project, and how can we ensure compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, and medical responsibility constraints?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
